    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/cba8309d49c45313d7a51409a5e88429.poster.avif?t=1755250914\" width=800 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/cba8309d49c45313d7a51409a5e88429.webm?t=1755250914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/cba8309d49c45313d7a51409a5e88429.mp4?t=1755250914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Bleed is a creepy and grotesque point-and-click adventure, made with a raw art style and disturbingly gory\u00a0hand-drawn animations. You find yourself in a horrible yet familiar place, facing your deepest fears and darkest thoughts. <strong><i>Nothing really dies here and you are all alone...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/74d23d21663617bea231475dd72273b4.poster.avif?t=1755250914\" width=800 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/74d23d21663617bea231475dd72273b4.webm?t=1755250914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/74d23d21663617bea231475dd72273b4.mp4?t=1755250914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raw art style and gory animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various gameplay styles for boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laughter and depression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal locations and bizarre characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Me, myself and I</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/bc1e94685b83b45ff55074cac2397da9.poster.avif?t=1755250914\" width=800 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/bc1e94685b83b45ff55074cac2397da9.webm?t=1755250914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736610/extras/bc1e94685b83b45ff55074cac2397da9.mp4?t=1755250914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
